      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The problem is partially found. Use Inputfield in some assets to send texts will cause crash in Quest. This is only problem i discovered earlier.\nMost part PC-Quest works, it's only Inputfield just don't work in Quest well. Quest has no onboard keyboard in VRChat, it has no physical keyboard.\nThat seems reason why Inputfield is not supported in Quest. Make virtual keyboard and store only in text object is good enough for most parts.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
